WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Cloud AI disappears the moment the signal does. LocalPass doesn't.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Download the Guatapé destination pack once. It's cached right on the device.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.200
Ask for a three hour, one hundred thousand peso plan. It fits the budget, and favors local-owned spots.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.700
Now, flip on simulate offline.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.900
Refresh the page. Still fully offline. Zero network calls.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:32.400
Ask again: two hours, fifty thousand pesos. A new plan, generated instantly, right on the device.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.800
Local businesses stay discoverable. No app to build, no commission, no connection required.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.900
Essential transport, health, and safety info. Always available, even with no signal.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:50.600
LocalPass: useful AI, for the devices and connectivity people actually have.
